# PROJECT: FREELANCE AI AGENT HUB

Build a complete, production-oriented, local-first AI freelance job discovery and work execution application for Windows.

The application must be a functioning full-stack system, not a static UI prototype. It should have a futuristic dashboard, a backend, database, AI agent orchestration, local model support, job discovery connectors, project workspaces, file generation, quality control, automation and a final submission center.

The system is designed to find freelance opportunities across multiple permitted job sources, analyze opportunities, generate proposals, perform approved work through local AI agents, verify deliverables and prepare completed projects for me to manually submit to clients.

I want to spend as little time as possible doing the actual work. AI agents should handle the research, planning, writing, coding, document creation, data processing, testing and packaging whenever technically possible.

I do NOT want graphic design jobs.

The system must prioritize local AI models and support external AI providers as optional fallbacks.

---

# 1. APPLICATION GOALS

Build an application that:

1. Searches configured freelance and remote earning platforms.
2. Discovers new job opportunities.
3. Imports and stores job listings.
4. Removes duplicate listings.
5. Automatically analyzes job requirements.
6. Filters jobs by my skills, preferences, budget and available resources.
7. Excludes graphic design jobs.
8. Detects scams and suspicious job listings.
9. Estimates work difficulty, time and potential earnings.
10. Ranks suitable jobs.
11. Generates personalized proposals.
12. Creates project plans.
13. Performs accepted freelance work through AI agents.
14. Creates real downloadable files and deliverables.
15. Uses an independent AI agent to check deliverables.
16. Automatically corrects errors within bounded limits.
17. Packages completed deliverables.
18. Generates a submission message.
19. Allows me to manually submit completed work to clients.
20. Tracks project progress and earnings.
21. Runs scheduled background tasks.
22. Runs locally on Windows.
23. Supports local AI through Ollama.
24. Supports optional API providers and fallback models.
25. Uses a resource-aware agent scheduler.
26. Protects my PC, files, accounts and credentials.

The application must not falsely claim that jobs were found, proposals were sent, work was completed, files were created or earnings were generated unless these actions were actually verified.

